# VITE_API_URL is OPTIONAL.
#
# - Single-process deploy (backend serves this frontend): leave it UNSET.
#   The app automatically talks to same-origin "/api".
#
# - Frontend hosted separately from the API: set the full API base URL, e.g.
#   VITE_API_URL=https://your-api-host.com/api
#
# - Local dev is handled automatically (defaults to http://localhost:4000/api),
#   so you only need this for LAN iPad testing against a separate backend:
#   VITE_API_URL=http://192.168.1.50:4000/api
